  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">has released the</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> answer key for the Join Integrated Program in Management Admission Test JIPMAT 2026</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">.&nbsp;</span>Applications for the NTA JIPMAT Online Form 2026 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">16 April 2026</span>, to 10 May 2026. The written examination was held on 07 June 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>10 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<strong>12-14 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>07 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>28 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>02 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>11 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 2200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 1100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Outside India : <strong>Rs. 11000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA JIPMAT Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No Age Limit For Any Candidates</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per NTA JIPMAT Online Form Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #0000ff;\"> </span>Tool – <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NTA JIPMAT Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: Joint Integrated Program in Management Admission Test JIPMAT 2026 (IIM Bodh Gaya &amp; IIM Jammu)</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Name</span>&nbsp;</strong>: National Eligibility Cum Entrance Test, 2026 (NTA)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA JIPMAT Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have completed their Class 12<sup>th</sup> level of Examination in 60% Marks from any recognized board will be eligible for this Examination.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For SC / ST Candidates Required : 55% Marks.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Passing year should be 2024<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkaridisha.com/upsssc-platoon-commander-recruitment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">,</a>&nbsp;2025, or appearing in 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate must have passed Class 10 not before 2022.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NTA JIPMAT Admissions Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on Online CBT Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026, Candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. / Login ID / Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password / DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code (if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their answer key from official site of the NTA.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%