leased?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes the NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026 has been released.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When was the NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026 officially announced?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026 has issued on 10 June 2026 by JIPMAT.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When will the NTA JIPMAT exam be held?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.</strong> The NTA JIPMAT examination was held on<strong> 07 June 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Where can I check the NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official NTA JIPMAT website: <strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">exams.nta.nic.in/jipmat/</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Q. What details are required to download the answer key?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong> to download the answer key<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is NTA JIPMAT Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of NTA JIPMAT is https://exams.nta.nic.in/jipmat/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
